<title>USA: Hewlett to triple toner-cartridge output.</title>
<headline>Hewlett to triple toner-cartridge output.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hewlett-Packard Co said it planned to triple production of toner cartridges used in the LaserJet 5Si family of network printers to alleviate a temporary shortage in the United States.</p>
<p>It said the shortage developed because sales of LaserJet 5Si and 5Si MX network printers were exceeding forecasts.</p>
</text>
